{"id":"594318","name":"精肉芦笋土豆沙拉","author":"不做妖精好多年","authorId":"1806550","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/594318/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"芦笋","amount":"130g"},{"name":"土豆","amount":"30g"},{"name":"精肉","amount":"90g"}],"sub":[{"name":"胡萝卜","amount":"20g"},{"name":"巴楚菌","amount":"3个"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"巴楚菌精肉汤。","img":"images/594318/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"取精肉，切块。","img":"images/594318/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"取3个巴楚菌。","img":"images/594318/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"芦笋洗净。","img":"images/594318/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"切段。","img":"images/594318/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"胡萝卜切段。","img":"images/594318/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"土豆切段。","img":"images/594318/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"土豆和胡萝卜冷水下锅，放芦笋根部。","img":"images/594318/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"放食盐，也可以不放，成品放小许盐也可以。","img":"images/594318/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"煮熟。","img":"images/594318/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"放芦笋中段。","img":"images/594318/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"煮开。","img":"images/594318/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"放芦笋尖。","img":"images/594318/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"煮开即可。","img":"images/594318/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"捞出大部分食材。","img":"images/594318/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"放精肉和巴楚菌。","img":"images/594318/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"放小许鸡精。","img":"images/594318/step_17.jpg"},{"step":18,"desc":"放剩下的食材。","img":"images/594318/step_18.jpg"},{"step":19,"desc":"拌匀。","img":"images/594318/step_19.jpg"},{"step":20,"desc":"整理一下。","img":"images/594318/step_20.jpg"},{"step":21,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/594318/step_21.jpg"}],"tips":"如果不瘦身，可以用沙拉酱来拌。 \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}